⦿ .spun — the five-fold spin of Norreen
node ARN · ARN · ⟦Norreen:ARN:e4627b⟧

WHO   — Norreen — the warrior · the ally and love
WHAT  — Garth's equal and his way home: she fights at his side, helps defeat Kuthuman, and gives the revenge story its turn toward a life after.
WHERE — ARN · Arena  Framework inputs: Arena (Forstchen, 1994)  Conductor / external anchor: ROOT0 (catalogued into UD0)
WHY   — Because the lone gunslinger's tale earns its ending only if someone makes him lay the wandering down — Norreen is that someone.
HOW   — By skill in the circles, courage against a planeswalker, and the love that turns vengeance into a future.

awareness — what the node knows of itself:
  I fought beside the stranger and helped him kill a god — and then I gave him the one thing revenge never could: a reason to stop walking.

